# 展示一次事件的快照与单个 state 的更新队列；不表达渲染次数或调度实现。
direction: down
**.style.font-size: 20
**.style.border-radius: 10
(** -> **)[*].style.font-size: 18

before: 本次渲染\nstock = 12
handler: 本次事件函数\n闭包读取 stock = 12
queue: 更新队列：依次处理 {
  style.fill: "#f4f8ff"
  style.stroke-dash: 4
  first: "pending => pending + 1\n12 → 13"
  second: "pending => pending + 1\n13 → 14"
  third: "pending => pending + 1\n14 → 15"
  first -> second -> third
}
after: 下一次渲染\nstock = 15\n生成新的事件函数 {
  style.fill: "#f6ffed"
  style.stroke: "#389e0d"
}
commit: 提交 DOM\n页面显示 15
later: 本次创建的延时回调\n仍读取旧 stock = 12 {
  style.fill: "#fff7e6"
  style.stroke: "#d48806"
}
before -> handler
handler -> queue.first: 排入三个 updater
queue.third -> after
after -> commit
handler -> later: 闭包保留本次绑定
